&lt;p>&amp;ldquo;金价破4200了！&amp;ldquo;&amp;ldquo;要不要追？&amp;ldquo;&amp;ldquo;我同事昨天刚买了100克金条&amp;quot;&amp;ldquo;现在上车还来得及吗？&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>黄金过山车：一周暴涨170美元又跌回，普通人该怎么投资？</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E8%BF%87%E5%B1%B1%E8%BD%A6%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E6%9A%B4%E6%B6%A8170%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E5%8F%88%E8%B7%8C%E5%9B%9E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%A5%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 04:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E9%BB%84%E9%87%91%E8%BF%87%E5%B1%B1%E8%BD%A6%E4%B8%80%E5%91%A8%E6%9A%B4%E6%B6%A8170%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E5%8F%88%E8%B7%8C%E5%9B%9E%E6%99%AE%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%BA%E8%AF%A5%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.ishareread.com/" alt="Featured image of post 黄金过山车：一周暴涨170美元又跌回，普通人该怎么投资？" />&lt;p>你身边一定有这样的朋友——&lt;/p>
